# Environment files strategy:
# - Commit .env.example (template for other developers)
# - Commit .env.development and .env.production (shared configs)
# - Ignore .env (developer's local copy)
# - Ignore any .local variants (personal overrides)

.env
.env*.local
.env.local
.env.personal

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated food-data review output
scripts/food-data/out/
